Git amend –

How to change last commit:

git pull
echo “line 1” > notes.txt
git add notes.txt
git commit -m “feat: add note file”
echo “metadata” > meta.txt
git add meta.txt
git commit –amend (amend the commit at the top in “feat” line)
git log –oneline (shows last commit)
git push

